Package: mscos-core
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: mescon <mescon@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/mescon/mscOS
Depends: pipewire, pipewire-alsa, wireplumber, alsa-utils, python3, curl, ca-certificates, iproute2, util-linux, passwd, systemd
Recommends: avahi-daemon, ethtool, device-tree-compiler
Description: mscOS: bit-perfect audio base for a network streamer
 The audio user and its PipeWire session (44.1 kHz, no resampling, the USB DAC as a
 raw device), board profiles, and boot-time tuning: one CPU core for audio and the
 USB interrupts, no frequency scaling, nothing unscheduled while music plays.
